{"text": "The biggest obstacle for AI in real world settings is that most human tasks are not nearly as tidy in their rules and boundaries. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Those gray areas like driving on busy city streets are where AI tools often falter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Despite years of expert forecasts of their imminent arrival, we do not yet have self driving cars that can safely replace human drivers, other than in controlled settings. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That is why some driverless taxis created chaos on the streets of San Francisco. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Despite years of optimistic predictions, many AI tools cannot yet be trusted in open world environments, where the human stakes are high, and failure means real, permanent loss. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> AI performance in these areas can still improve, as the size of AI models grows, and they are trained on more human driving data. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But they will improve only by mirroring more of the patterns found in our intelligent performances, as we cope with a world that no data set can ever contain.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "i", "g", "g", "e", "s", "t", " ", "o", "b", "s", "t", "a", "c", "l", "e", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "A", "I", " ", "i", "n", " ", "r", "e", "a", "l", " ", "w", "o", "r", "l", "d", " ", "s", "e", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", "s", " ", "i", "s", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "m", "o", "s", "t", " ", "h", "u", "m", "a", "n", " ", "t", "a", "s", "k", "s", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "n", "e", "a", "r", "l", "y", " ", "a", "s", " ", "t", "i", "d", "y", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "i", "r", " ", "r", "u", "l", "e", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "b", "o", "u", "n", "d", "a", "r", "i", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "o", "s", "e", " ", "g", "r", "a", "y", " ", "a", "r", "e", "a", "s", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "d", "r",